WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:10.100
In a project, go down to its tasks

2
00:00:10.100 --> 00:00:13.700
Open the task

3
00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:18.900
Pull the sheet up to Subtasks

4
00:00:18.900 --> 00:00:24.000
Under Subtasks, type a step

5
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:28.600
Return adds it

6
00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:32.300
Tick a step off when it's done

7
00:00:32.300 --> 00:00:34.800
The task counts them: 1 of 3 done

8
00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:38.500
Back in the project…

9
00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:48.000
…the task's row shows the count too
